    <mediaPropertyDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[Designed by Philip Webb, Standen House in West Sussex is one of the finest surviving examples of Arts and Crafts workmanship, with Morris & Co interiors and a hillside garden overlooking the Medway Valley.]]></Value>
